[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308799636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110356#issuecomment-3308799636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110356","id":3308799636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FOEaU","user":{"login":"cyber-mancer","id":54824828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODI0ODI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54824828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer","html_url":"https://github.com/cyber-mancer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T17:51:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T17:51:12Z","body":"Also have this on wayland!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3308799636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315176970","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110356#issuecomment-3315176970","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110356","id":3315176970,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmZYK","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T19:02:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T19:02:44Z","body":"I can reproduce this (Linux Mint, X11), but it seems timing dependent and is extremely rare if a debugger is attached to godot, which explains why we didn't see it normally during engine dev. \n\nIn the official 4.5-stable build, I can get it to happen basically 100% of the time, but getting it to reproduce on a local build was extremely finicky, and basically never happened with a debugger on it.\n\nBased on the limited logging I managed to get on some failures, the new process gets created successfully, but then is almost immediately killed by a second call to `EditorRun::stop`. This call to `stop` occurs every time the bug occurs, and only occurs when the bug does. It comes from the following stacktrace:\n\n```\n[1] EditorRunBar::stop_playing() (editor/run/editor_run_bar.cpp:423)\n[2] EditorNode::notify_all_debug_sessions_exited() (editor/editor_node.cpp:5048)\n[3] EditorDebuggerNode::_debugger_stopped(int p_id) (editor/debugger/editor_debugger_node.cpp:483)\n...\n  Signal processing, ScriptEditorDebugger emitted \"stopped\" \n...\n[13] ScriptEditorDebugger::_stop_and_notify() (editor/debugger/script_editor_debugger.cpp:1257)\n[14] ScriptEditorDebugger::_notification (editor/debugger/script_editor_debugger.cpp:1142)\n...\n  Main loop, calls `_notification` with `NOTIFICATION_PROCESS`\n```\n\nThe issue appears to be a race condition, where if the debugger sees nothing attached for a frame, it kills everything, but if the new process is in the middle of starting up, it can end up getting killed.\n\nBisecting this led me to #90034, but I think that just exposed an existing issue by changing the timing, I don't think it actually introduced the problem. \n\nI'm going to set this down for now, I'm not familiar enough with this part of the codebase to know what to change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315176970/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3322229772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110356#issuecomment-3322229772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110356","id":3322229772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GBTQM","user":{"login":"cyber-mancer","id":54824828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODI0ODI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54824828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer","html_url":"https://github.com/cyber-mancer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyber-mancer/subscriptions",